#: includes/devices.php:120
msgid "Work Area"
msgstr "Área de trabajo"

#: includes/devices.php:121
msgid "Description of the work area in the structured cabling."
msgstr "Descripción del área de trabajo en el cableado estructurado."

#: includes/devices.php:130
msgid "Horizontal Cabling"
msgstr "Cableado horizontal"

#: includes/devices.php:131
msgid "Connects the work area to the telecommunications room."
msgstr "Conecta el área de trabajo con el armario de telecomunicaciones."

#: includes/devices.php:140
msgid "Telecommunications Room"
msgstr "Armario de telecomunicaciones"

#: includes/devices.php:141
msgid "Room housing patch panels and intermediate connection devices."
msgstr "Sala donde se alojan paneles de parcheo y dispositivos de conexión intermedia."

#: includes/devices.php:150
msgid "Equipment Room"
msgstr "Sala de equipos"

#: includes/devices.php:151
msgid "Central room with equipment such as switches, DVR, ISP router and UPS."
msgstr "Sala central con equipos como switch, DVR, router del proveedor de internet y UPS."

#: includes/devices.php:160
msgid "Backbone Cabling"
msgstr "Cableado backbone"

#: includes/devices.php:161
msgid "Links telecommunications rooms and equipment rooms."
msgstr "Vincula los armarios de telecomunicaciones con las salas de equipos."

#: includes/devices.php:170
msgid "Entrance Facility"
msgstr "Instalación de entrada"

#: includes/devices.php:171
msgid "Point where the external cabling enters the building and connects to the internal network."
msgstr "Punto donde el cableado externo ingresa al edificio y se conecta con la red interna."

#: includes/devices.php:180
msgid "ISP Equipment"
msgstr "Equipo del proveedor de internet"

#: includes/devices.php:181
msgid "Includes modem or router provided by the ISP, usually located in the equipment room."
msgstr "Incluye el módem o router proporcionado por el proveedor de internet, normalmente ubicado en la sala de equipos."

#: includes/devices.php:190
msgid "UPS System"
msgstr "Sistema UPS"

#: includes/devices.php:191
msgid "Uninterruptible Power Supply to keep network equipment running during outages."
msgstr "Sistema de alimentación ininterrumpida que mantiene los equipos de red en funcionamiento durante cortes de energía."

